<p>Hey {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},&nbsp;I hope your March has been a wonderful one so far!<br />
<br />
I wanted to reach out to you regarding some exciting updates for StateFarm Agents, effective April 1st, auto lead subsidy will be back in the following states GA, NC and TN!<br />
<br />
EverQuote has recently implemented some new updates to optimize our agents experience. We are committed to being your preferred lead vendor! We are currently and have been enhancing our search engines to deliver the highest quality leads to our agents.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;In addition to enhancing lead quality we are also dedicated to being a support system for your agency through out your lead buying experience.<br />
<br />
All CORE or AGP accounts will be assigned a team of dedicated senior reps who will manage their account. The migration into this support system will ensure that when some individuals aren't available you'll always have someone there who can assist you. After your first onboarding meeting into the CORE or AGP Program, a 14 day check-in will be scheduled with your first line support manager. From there, a member of your team will conduct quarterly or monthly reviews (Depending on which program you qualify for) to generate cost per acquisition and to overall optimize your account. And no need to worry, your line of support will always be available. At your time of enrollment you'll receive a direct phone number and email to your line of support with your teams direct extension!<br />
<br />
Feel free to book time on my calendar if that's easier down below.</p>

